.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="On an ill-conditioned convex quadratic, plain gradient descent reduces the objective gap like O(1/k) until the strongly convex regime kicks in; Nesterov&#x27;s accelerated gradient, with the same step size, achieves the optimal first-order rate O(1/k^2).">

