.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Minimizes a quadratic using only noisy gradient observations. With Robbins and Monro&#x27;s step sizes a_k = a_0/(k+1), the noise averages out and the error shrinks like 1/\sqrt{k}. A constant step size instead stalls at a noise floor.">

